{"steam_appid":3498270,"steam_name":"Better Mart Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3498270/1635496999/a02fc494c6c913c8e8d76844d689d634023a6b22/1783604436/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783691307","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257373649/5cc3d53b31009246a56006cefde344d11e75d3dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783691307","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/bbe6c366867128be9238db2974de38e839d8ac03/ss_bbe6c366867128be9238db2974de38e839d8ac03.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783934002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/5c31c6e46abc43270e9523490f804c194339ff97/ss_5c31c6e46abc43270e9523490f804c194339ff97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783934002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/dccff598c081cb803a5b3a6caf1fabbc7a48854d/ss_dccff598c081cb803a5b3a6caf1fabbc7a48854d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783934002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/65a322d0b14c8a5559f313a6961a991a5304a2ad/ss_65a322d0b14c8a5559f313a6961a991a5304a2ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783934002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/414357f054d83d3a72d119bd9af133a2acb0bfb2/ss_414357f054d83d3a72d119bd9af133a2acb0bfb2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783934002"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, manage and grow the supermarket you've always dreamed of!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> Better Mart Simulator, </strong>an immersive management game playable in first or third person, where every decision shapes the future of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a small shop and gradually transform it into a thriving supermarket. Design every aisle, expand your store, unlock new specialized sections, and adapt your offerings to meet the demands of an ever-growing customer base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free to customize everything: aisle layout, product placement, decoration, prices, and much more. Optimize every square foot to improve your customers' experience and grow your revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage inventory, place orders, restock shelves, hire staff, and make the right decisions to grow your business day after day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play <strong>solo or with up to 6 players</strong> in co-op, every choice counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to build the city's must-visit supermarket?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you in Better Mart Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bd783a74f2ff879fa67864b9640d7c5a.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/4978e1deb7c340242d4c072fcc01aed1.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/4978e1deb7c340242d4c072fcc01aed1.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/4978e1deb7c340242d4c072fcc01aed1.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your supermarket with up to 6 players!</strong> Team up to optimize every task, split up the roles, and grow your business faster... Or challenge each other to prove who's the best manager. Experience cooperative management like never before fun, chaotic, and totally unique, where your team's coordination makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/4e74551b7ef40c67786a3ce60dc91ed0.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/cd7704c2eae944af00ed6c4e71d88510.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/cd7704c2eae944af00ed6c4e71d88510.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/cd7704c2eae944af00ed6c4e71d88510.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare and bake a wide variety of cakes to maximize your sales and satisfy every customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/4f4a5500b43f76b708fd16ef9a9d08a4.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2ed0e2d7fef765e870ac6ec6b6024142.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2ed0e2d7fef765e870ac6ec6b6024142.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2ed0e2d7fef765e870ac6ec6b6024142.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the aisles, repair your machines, and monitor overall satisfaction to protect your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1386a8008387ada7eb5d6a26830c65cb.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/e03fb488441d8aa8009e86a200b18a55.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/e03fb488441d8aa8009e86a200b18a55.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/e03fb488441d8aa8009e86a200b18a55.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload pallets, operate the pallet jack and stacker to fill your storage and stock your shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/72ac073dde2584efa533252fe9c47231.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/a388d6c5355a3757f9e4ac88127c7c87.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/a388d6c5355a3757f9e4ac88127c7c87.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/a388d6c5355a3757f9e4ac88127c7c87.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange the shelves, decorate, design, and create a unique place where customers will love to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/0a346fd0c8001873e74e56d1e9319507.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/be6e0c53fe28b214a3beb08e59a83ea0.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/be6e0c53fe28b214a3beb08e59a83ea0.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/be6e0c53fe28b214a3beb08e59a83ea0.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your stock, anticipate shortages, place your orders, and adjust your prices to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/607b199930f08e92c61653f7ef744525.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2426d8515c91e981d5b4705a39503277.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2426d8515c91e981d5b4705a39503277.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2426d8515c91e981d5b4705a39503277.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new specialized sections: bakery, butcher shop, wine cellar, jewelry, appliances, fruits and vegetables, fresh &amp; frozen. Diversify your offerings to attract even more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/a8764030a4f54284cd7bd685dea07cac.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2821e051d2427364861eeacc55decb8f.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2821e051d2427364861eeacc55decb8f.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/2821e051d2427364861eeacc55decb8f.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize your store: change the colors, modify the floor and wall materials, choose your store's name, and decorate each space according to your style to create your one-of-a-kind supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/d2d8972b358063f61f7a77d6033d973e.avif?t=1783934002\" width=1280 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/c282597a3d37ecd39df388e084875584.poster.avif?t=1783934002\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/c282597a3d37ecd39df388e084875584.webm?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/c282597a3d37ecd39df388e084875584.mp4?t=1783934002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, train, and manage your employees. Improve their skills and invest in ever more efficient equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Grow your supermarket:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small shop, gradually expand your supermarket, open new sections, and grow your business to attract even more customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to build the supermarket of your dreams?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the demo and discover a cooperative management experience like nothing you've ever played.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD quad-core, 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / At least 4GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Please install the game on SSD for better performance</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD quad-core, 2.5 GHz or +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / 6-8GB of VRAM recommanded<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Please install the game on SSD for better performance</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Exanticx Studio"],"publishers":["Exanticx Studio"],"release_date":"16 May, 2025"}